          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is Heart Ritual safe to take with my current medications?",
            "a": "<p>Heart Ritual is a dietary supplement and doesn’t replace any medication. Nattokinase, garlic and vitamin K2 can interact with blood thinners such as warfarin or aspirin, and with blood pressure medication. If you take any medication or have surgery coming up, talk to your doctor before you start.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How should I store Heart Ritual?",
            "a": "<p>Keep the pouch sealed in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight, and press the zip closed after each use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will Heart Ritual help with my cardiovascular wellness and energy levels?",
            "a": "<p>Heart Ritual is designed to support healthy circulation, heart health and cellular energy. Beetroot supports nitric oxide, garlic and nattokinase support healthy blood flow, CoQ10 fuels heart cells and vitamin K2 helps direct calcium to your bones.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long until I notice a difference?",
            "a": "<p>Everyone is different. Ingredients like CoQ10 build up over weeks, so give it at least 60 days of daily use. That’s why our guarantee is 60 days.*</p>"
          }
        },
